<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Feel complete</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">PinkPantheress</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Heaven knows</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2bBh5UwbVLkA3WB44iXBye</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.325" end="00:21.684">Oh no, baby, oh no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.684" end="00:24.135">You never took the time to phone home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.135" end="00:26.501">You never took a vow to not go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.501" end="00:28.902">I'm loving you a little like slow mo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.902" end="00:31.278">Baby, oh no, baby, oh wait</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.278" end="00:33.711">Even when you want to sleep late</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.711" end="00:35.994">Even when your eyes can't see straight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.994" end="00:38.359">I need to find another one (Another one), another one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.359" end="00:39.859" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.971" end="00:43.793">I'm not going to bed because you want me to (Want me too)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.793" end="00:48.692">Tell me why you allow alcohol get to you (Get to you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.692" end="00:52.238">I never wanted to end this book, this fairytale (Fairytale)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.238" end="00:53.738" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.192" end="00:55.695">Not another drink this week</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.695" end="00:58.542">I just want to feel complete</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.542" end="01:00.042" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.775" end="01:04.743">I guess I never knew you very well (Knew you very well)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.743" end="01:09.609">I guess I never knew you very well (Knew you very well)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.609" end="01:14.419">I guess I never knew you very well (Knew you very well)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.419" end="01:16.517">I guess I never knew you very well (Knew you very well)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.517" end="01:18.017" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.911" end="01:19.923">Don't say that I'm getting you wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.923" end="01:22.433">Money came today and so you'll get what you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.433" end="01:24.822">I wish that it would end when it stopped being fun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.822" end="01:26.573">He's not feeling well is what I tell everyone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.573" end="01:28.073" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.645" end="01:29.863">Yesterday I took a sip of your rum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.863" end="01:32.446">I don't think today I'll face anyone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.446" end="01:34.513">I can't imagine feeling that everyday</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.513" end="01:36.680">You buy another bottle and drink it all anyway, so</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.680" end="01:39.041" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.041" end="01:43.507">I guess I never knew you very well (Knew you very well)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.507" end="01:48.484">I guess I never knew you very well (Knew you very well)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.484" end="01:53.328">I guess I never knew you very well (Knew you very well)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.328" end="01:57.528">I guess I never knew you very well (Knew you very well)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.528" end="02:05.528" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.460" end="02:17.460">I just want to feel complete</p></div></body></tt>